  "bodyHash": "a889cec7a5e8e167",
  "content": "\n\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fserilum.com%252f\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://cdn.serilum.com/description/header/header.png\" alt=\"一款 Serilum 模组。用心制作。为 Fabric、Forge 和 Neo 提供了大量活跃的模组！\" width=\"838\" height=\"400\"></a></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><a href=\"https://curseforge.com/members/serilum/projects\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://workflow.serilum.com/badges/svg/curseforge.svg\" alt=\"CurseForge\" width=\"200\"></a> <a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fuser%252fSerilum\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://workflow.serilum.com/badges/svg/modrinth.svg\" alt=\"Modrinth\" width=\"200\"></a> <a href=\"https://patreon.com/serilum\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://workflow.serilum.com/badges/svg/patreon.svg\" alt=\"Patreon\" width=\"200\"></a> <a href=\"https://youtube.com/@serilum\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://workflow.serilum.com/badges/svg/youtube.svg\" alt=\"YouTube\" width=\"200\"></a></p>\n<h2><br><img src=\"https://cdn.serilum.com/description/nameplate/about-the-mod.svg\" alt=\"关于模组\" width=\"838\" height=\"64\"></h2>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:18px\">Ore Harvester 允许玩家在蹲下时破坏其中的一个方块，从而瞬间开采整个矿脉。开采所需的时间会根据矿脉中矿石的数量而增加。所有掉落的矿石物品都会生成在被破坏的第一个方块的位置。它兼容精准采集和其他任何附魔。只要对角线连接的方块在空气中可见，也会被一起破坏。<br><br>该模组提供了多种配置选项以自定义其行为。此外还有一个黑名单文件，您可以在其中指定哪些镐子允许使用此模组的功能。<br><br>本模组旨在与我的 <a style=\"font-size:18px\" href=\"https://curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/tree-harvester\" rel=\"nofollow\">Tree Harvester</a> 模组配合使用。</span></p>\n<h2><br><br><img src=\"https://cdn.serilum.com/description/nameplate/dependencies.svg\" alt=\"依赖项\" width=\"838\" height=\"64\"></h2>\n<p><a href=\"https://curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/collective\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://cdn.serilum.com/description/badges/dependencies/requires/collective.svg\" alt=\"需要 Collective\" width=\"251\" height=\"49\"></a><br><a href=\"https://curseforge.com/minecraft/modpacks/the-vanilla-experience\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://cdn.serilum.com/description/badges/dependencies/includes/the-vanilla-experience.svg\" alt=\"包含于 The Vanilla Experience\" width=\"350\" height=\"49\"></a><a href=\"https://curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/serilums-qol-bundle\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://cdn.serilum.com/description/badges/dependencies/includes/qol-bundle.svg\" alt=\"包含于 Serilum 的 QoL 包\" width=\"334\" height=\"49\"></a><br><img src=\"https://cdn.serilum.com/description/badges/environment/server.svg\" alt=\"环境：服务端\" width=\"220\" height=\"49\"></p>\n<h2><br><br><br><img src=\"https://cdn.serilum.com/description/nameplate/configurable.svg\" alt=\"可配置\" width=\"838\" height=\"64\"></h2>\n<p><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fserilum.com%252fconfiguration-guide\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://cdn.serilum.com/description/badges/configuration-guide.svg\" alt=\"配置指南\" width=\"220\" height=\"49\"></a></p>\n<p>&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;<span style=\"font-size:18px\">所有可用的配置选项：</span></p>\n<div class=\"spoiler\" style=\"margin-left:10px;padding-left:10px\">\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><strong>oreHarvestWithoutSneak</strong></span><span style=\"font-size:12px;color:#8a8d91\">&nbsp;&nbsp;默认 false</span><br><span style=\"font-size:13px\">如果启用，则在未按住潜行键时即可进行矿石开采。如果禁用，则效果相反，仅在潜行时生效。</span><br><br><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><strong>dropOresAtFirstBrokenBlock</strong></span><span style=\"font-size:12px;color:#8a8d91\">&nbsp;&nbsp;默认 true</span><br><span style=\"font-size:13px\">开采矿脉时，所有掉落的矿石是否都生成在被破坏的第一个方块的位置。</span><br><br><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><strong>enableFuzzyOreSearch</strong></span><span style=\"font-size:12px;color:#8a8d91\">&nbsp;&nbsp;默认 true</span><br><span style=\"font-size:13px\">启用模糊搜索后，它将使用方块的原始名称来判断其是否为矿石方块。这提高了与未设置方块标签的其他模组的兼容性，但会产生较小的误判概率。</span><br><br><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><strong>loseDurabilityPerHarvestedOre</strong></span><span style=\"font-size:12px;color:#8a8d91\">&nbsp;&nbsp;默认 true</span><br><span style=\"font-size:13px\">如果启用，每开采一个矿石，手持的镐子就会消耗耐久度。</span><br><br><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><strong>loseDurabilityModifier</strong></span><span style=\"font-size:12px;color:#8a8d91\">&nbsp;&nbsp;默认 1.0，最小值 0.001，最大值 1.0</span><br><span style=\"font-size:13px\">在此设置开采一个矿脉应从镐子上扣除多少耐久度。例如设置为 0.1，意味着每开采 10 个矿石消耗 1 点耐久。</span><br><br><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><strong>increaseExhaustionPerHarvestedOre</strong></span><span style=\"font-size:12px;color:#8a8d91\">&nbsp;&nbsp;默认 true</span><br><span style=\"font-size:13px\">如果启用，玩家每开采一个矿石，疲劳值将增加 0.005（Minecraft 默认的每次破坏方块）* increaseExhaustionModifier。</span><br><br><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><strong>increaseExhaustionModifier</strong></span><span style=\"font-size:12px;color:#8a8d91\">&nbsp;&nbsp;默认 1.0，最小值 0.001，最大值 1.0</span><br><span style=\"font-size:13px\">此选项决定玩家每开采一个矿石应增加的疲劳值。默认为 0.005 * 1.0。</span><br><br><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><strong>increaseHarvestingTimePerOre</strong></span><span style=\"font-size:12px;color:#8a8d91\">&nbsp;&nbsp;默认 true</span><br><span style=\"font-size:13px\">如果启用，开采时间会随矿脉中存在的矿石数量而增加。具体数值由 'increasedHarvestingTimePerOreModifier' 决定。</span><br><br><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><strong>increasedHarvestingTimePerOreModifier</strong></span><span style=\"font-size:12px;color:#8a8d91\">&nbsp;&nbsp;默认 0.2，最小值 0.01，最大值 10.0</span><br><span style=\"font-size:13px\">启用 'increaseHarvestingTimePerOre' 后，开采矿脉所需延长的时间。实际速度计算公式为：newSpeed = originalSpeed / (1 + (logCount * increasedHarvestingTimePerOreModifier))。</span><br><br></p>\n<p><br><span style=\"font-size:24px\"><strong>镐子黑名单功能：</strong></span><br>您可以仅允许特定的镐子来开采矿脉。模组首次加载时会生成一个黑名单文件。它位于 <strong><em>./config/oreharvester/harvestable_pickaxe_blacklist.txt</em></strong>。此功能同样适用于模组添加的镐子物品。<br><img src=\"https://cdn.serilum.com/projects/ore-harvester/a.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"994\" height=\"622\"></p>\n</div>\n<h2><br><br><br><img src=\"https://cdn.serilum.com/description/nameplate/showcase.svg\" alt=\"展示\" width=\"838\" height=\"64\"></h2>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px\">开采矿脉中的任意矿石，其中的所有方块都会被破坏：</span></p>\n<div class=\"spoiler\">\n<p><img src=\"https://cdn.serilum.com/projects/ore-harvester/b.webp\" alt=\"\"></p>\n</div>\n<p>&nbsp;<br><span style=\"font-size:14px\">兼容精准采集及其他任何附魔：</span></p>\n<div class=\"spoiler\">\n<p><img src=\"https://cdn.serilum.com/projects/ore-harvester/c.webp\" alt=\"\"></p>\n</div>\n<h2><br><br><br><img src=\"https://cdn.serilum.com/description/nameplate/notes-n-links.svg\" alt=\"注意事项与链接\" width=\"838\" height=\"64\"></h2>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:24px\"><strong>您可以自由在任何整合包中使用此模组，只要下载源仍托管在 CurseForge 或 Modrinth 生态内即可。</strong></span><br><br><span style=\"font-size:18px\"><a style=\"font-size:18px;color:#008000\" href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fserilum.com%252f\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Serilum.com</a> 提供了所有可用模组的概览及更多信息。</span><br><br><span style=\"font-size:14px\">由于我无法在如此多的独立模组页面中跟踪评论，因此已关闭评论功能。</span><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><br>如有问题、想法、建议或其他内容，请访问&nbsp;<a style=\"font-size:14px;color:#008000\" href=\"https://github.com/Serilum/.issue-tracker\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">GitHub 仓库</a>。谢谢！</span><span style=\"font-size:6px\"><br><br></span></p>",
